Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: qcom_smbx: enable HVDCP for AYN Odin

The AYN Odin supports Quick Charge. Enable HVDCP negotiation for this
device while keeping the generic SMBX default unchanged for other devices.

---
 drivers/power/supply/qcom_smbx.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/power/supply/qcom_smbx.c b/drivers/power/supply/qcom_smbx.c
--- a/drivers/power/supply/qcom_smbx.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/qcom_smbx.c
@@ -817,3 +817,4 @@ static const struct smb_init_register smb_init_seq[] = {
 	/* Enable charging */
-	{ .addr = USBIN_OPTIONS_1_CFG, .mask = HVDCP_EN_BIT, .val = 0 },
+	/* AYN Odin supports Quick Charge; allow HVDCP negotiation. */
+	{ .addr = USBIN_OPTIONS_1_CFG, .mask = HVDCP_EN_BIT, .val = HVDCP_EN_BIT },
 	{ .addr = CHARGING_ENABLE_CMD,
